# What never reaches the webroot.
#
# rsync --exclude-from reads this, and --delete-excluded means anything on the
# server matching a line here is removed rather than left to rot. The list is the
# table in README.md, "Ships but is not part of the site", made executable — change
# one and change the other.
#
# Patterns without a slash match the basename at any depth, which is why the single
# README.md line below covers the root one and the notes in assets/*/ alike.

.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.deployignore
tools/
README.md

# The 3.4MB master. The page only ever asks for the three magnolia-*.jpg variants
# beside it; the master exists so tools/make-variants.mjs can rebuild them.
assets/img/magnolia.jpg

# Source, not served. css/tokens/fonts.css links only the woff2 of each face and
# says so: "The .ttf is kept as the source; only the woff2 is served."
assets/fonts/*.ttf
